        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, proposes an architecture based on our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform. our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform can provide an intelligent assistance tool that meets the client's requirements. our Atelier platform consists of several components, including a document-ingestion pipeline, vector store, retrieval layer with hybrid search, orchestration layer, and answer layer." ;
